    "description": {
      "content": "Uppsala Conflict Data Program (UCDP) RESTful HTTP API returning JSON for UCDP conflict datasets: georeferenced events, UCDP/PRIO armed conflict, dyadic, non-state, one-sided violence, battle-related deaths, and organized violence country-year. Access requires a free token supplied in the x-ucdp-access-token header (quota 5,000 requests/day).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Uppsala Conflict Data Program",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
